The Healer's a difficult character to get going, but he does have some 
useful advantages.  I've yet to finish the game with a Healer, but I'm
getting there :-)

Anyway, here are some pros & cons:

ADVANTAGES:
  Starts with poison resistance - very useful, it makes drinking from
  fountains a good deal safer.

  Gets lots of money and a high charisma - can you say shopping spree?

  The wand of sleep's handy.

  Lots of healing potions - my strategy is to drink the whole lot at the
  beginning and get my HP up.  If you;re lucky, you can get about 28HP as
  a first level character - quite necessary for survival.

  Spellbooks of healing & extra healing - always blessed, so read 'em!

DISADVANTAGES:

  Hopeless at fighting.

  Weak.

There you go.

